sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant UI as UI (MediaController)
    participant Session as MediaSession (single truth)
    participant Player as Media3 Player
    participant Notif as Media notification (Ch 46/50)
    participant BT as Bluetooth

    User->>UI: tap pause
    UI->>Session: pause command
    Session->>Player: pause
    Player-->>Session: state = paused
    Session-->>Notif: update (paused) — no drift
    Session-->>UI: state = paused
    User->>BT: press play on headset
    BT->>Session: play command
    Session->>Player: play
    Player-->>Session: playing -> all surfaces update
